  "notable_quotes": [
    "Iodine uptake by compound 1 reaches about 39.5 wt%, and the adsorption process is reversible.",
    "Activated compound 1 shows permanent microporosity, evidenced by a reversible type-I N2 isotherm and BET/Langmuir surface areas of 229.7/321.7 m2 g−1.",
    "The iodine loading of compound 1 is only slightly above zeolite 13X and remains below activated carbon and some MOFs."
